Line 4: I don't know a sentence that starts with "x".
    x is 5
    ^
To keep a value in a name, write "let x be ...". To change it, write "set x to ...".

Line 5: I don't know a sentence that starts with "total".
    total = 5
    ^^^^^
To keep a value in a name, write "let total be ...". To change it, write "set total to ...".

Line 6: A sentence can't start with "1".
    1 plus 2
    ^
Sentences start with a word like "let", "set", "say" or "ask".

